@startuml
actor Lecturer
actor "Head of Department" as HOD
actor Moderator
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Review API" as API
participant "Review Service" as Review
participant PostgreSQL as DB

Lecturer -> UI: Submit exact output version for review
UI -> API: POST teaching-output workflow
API -> DB: Set output under_review
HOD -> UI: Create review cycle and assign reviewer
UI -> API: POST /reviews/cycles
API -> Review: Authorise scope and build sealed pack
Review -> DB: Create cycle, pack, items and task
Review --> UI: Cycle number, version and task status
Moderator -> UI: Open assigned Review tasks
UI -> API: GET /reviews/tasks
API -> DB: Query only assigned_user_id
API --> UI: Assigned tasks only
@enduml
